{"ID":"20240519171009-th80gjl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f3b8","id":"20240519171009-th80gjl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519171009-th80gjl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519171020-13nhuz2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519171404-vaxqgg9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519171020-13nhuz2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"7.優質的中醫書籍","type":"doc","updated":"20240523091902"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240519171020-13nhuz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171020-13nhuz2","updated":"20240519171050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.黃帝內經     "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171033-x099t72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171033-x099t72","updated":"20240519171057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"2.神農本草經    "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171034-4q5c13i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171034-4q5c13i","updated":"20240519171058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"3.傷寒論  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171040-9dh8013","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171040-9dh8013","updated":"20240519171059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"4.金匱    "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171041-uym6tq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171041-uym6tq8","updated":"20240519171100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"5.針灸大成   "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171042-exfcxbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171042-exfcxbc","updated":"20240519171100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"6.傷寒雜病論  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171042-74bkg8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171042-74bkg8g","updated":"20240519171101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"7.千金要方 翼方(古籍部份)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171043-t602l6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171043-t602l6h","updated":"20240519171123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 22px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"近代優良中醫書籍\n1.中西匯通醫書五種 (四川唐容川 字宗海著)\n2.傷寒發微 , 金匱發微 (江蘇淮陰曹穎甫著)\n3.傷寒論新義 , 金匱要略新義  (余無言著)\n4.單穴治病選萃     (人民衛生出版社)\n5.疾病預測學   (楊力著 北京科學出版社)\n6.經方實驗錄 (姜佐景著).\n7.針灸大成  明朝楊繼州編寫.\n8.思考中醫 廣西劉力紅教授著."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 22px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171022-xqf9jvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171022-xqf9jvs"}},{"ID":"20240519171358-tqddqxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171358-tqddqxe","updated":"20240519171403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"還有很多好的中醫書籍,在大陸出版我手邊有,我會陸續建議的. 還有許多海外孤本 , 極富學術價值 , 我就算說出來 , 大家也不容易找到 , 好像命中注定我會閱覽到 , 不要還不行 . 好累啊!!  想做好人也不行 , 想跟時醫ㄧ起同流合污也不行 , 給自己這麼多的壓力 , 在海外又無奧援 , 好像是命運之神在控制捉弄我 , 想不幹都不行 , 不扛起復興中國正統中醫文化的工作都不行."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519171404-vaxqgg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519171404-vaxqgg9","updated":"20240519171410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月16日"}]}]}